    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Virtual Sea Aquarium!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a tranquil underwater world designed to soothe your mind and lift your spirit. This virtual aquarium is not just a visual experience but a space for calm reflection, mindfulness, and gentle escape from the noise of daily life. Allow the graceful movement of the fish and the serene aquatic scenery to guide you into a state of relaxation. Breathe deeply, let go of tension, and simply enjoy the meditative rhythm of this underwater sanctuary. No goals, no pressure\u2014just peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals, no controls\u2014just pure visual serenity.</p>",
